<title>UK: Industrial Bank of Korea sets $110 mln 3-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Industrial Bank of Korea sets $110 mln 3-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INDUSTRIAL BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMT    $110 MLN	SPREAD     +10 BP    MATURITY	.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> EXP MOODY  A1	  ISS PRICE  99.875    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-100   SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
